    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the higher ups are saying manual mode is way more cost-effective, even if it might be less precise. they're actually leaning towards starting the transition next month to cut the overhead. if we moved to manual, how much of a drop in CO2 capture efficiency are we realistically looking at?",
